# Made by tools: the installed packages and the build
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
# this machine's own settings, the gateway's token among them (.env.local)
**/*.local
# Not in the repository: the scripts that prepare the match data, the data made from broadcast footage, the footage
# itself and the speech model. The demo club and its venues are our own, so they are published; so is the 3D anatomy
# model in public/body/ (BodyParts3D, CC BY 4.0: its credit and the changes made to it are in public/body/ATTRIBUTION.md).
**/scripts/
public/data/*
!public/data/club.json
!public/data/venues.json
# the sample health export (made up) and the measured Autopilot numbers the About page shows
!public/data/sample/
!public/data/agent_eval.json
/public/media/*
!/public/media/favicon.svg
# short sample clips for the highlight reel, trimmed from CC BY 3.0 videos (CREDITS.md)
!public/media/samples/
/public/models/
